{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00157",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 6.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I brought my bag, is it fine to leave it here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.0,
      "end_seconds": 11.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.73,
      "end_seconds": 15.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I wanted to get sneezing fits looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.87,
      "end_seconds": 17.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.77,
      "end_seconds": 22.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "It's been going on for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.98,
      "end_seconds": 29.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.08,
      "end_seconds": 45.11,
      "duration_seconds": 15.03,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day. Antihistamines helps a bit. My sister suggested writing things down, uh, but I forgot. And itchy watery eyes, too. As for itchy watery eyes, it's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.43,
      "end_seconds": 49.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.37,
      "end_seconds": 55.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Yes, uh, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.52,
      "end_seconds": 60.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Any fever, shortness of breath or facial pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.89,
      "end_seconds": 65.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "No fever, shortness of breath or facial pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.11,
      "end_seconds": 81.41,
      "duration_seconds": 15.3,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.44,
      "end_seconds": 85.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 87.11,
      "end_seconds": 94.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 66, blood pressure 108 over 68, temperature 36.8. Saturation 99 percent, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.42,
      "end_seconds": 110.1,
      "duration_seconds": 14.68,
      "text": "Good, thank you. I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.69,
      "end_seconds": 113.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.61,
      "end_seconds": 119.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.67,
      "end_seconds": 123.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Ibuprofen. I come out in... well, stomach pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.36,
      "end_seconds": 127.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.62,
      "end_seconds": 143.15,
      "duration_seconds": 14.53,
      "text": "Uh, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.61,
      "end_seconds": 146.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.41,
      "end_seconds": 150.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, uh, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.63,
      "end_seconds": 160.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.59,
      "end_seconds": 164.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "No, nothing, I've generally been healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.53,
      "end_seconds": 168.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.54,
      "end_seconds": 172.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.8,
      "end_seconds": 176.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.0,
      "end_seconds": 180.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.76,
      "end_seconds": 185.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.49,
      "end_seconds": 187.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.67,
      "end_seconds": 199.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.17,
      "end_seconds": 206.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.92,
      "end_seconds": 223.95,
      "duration_seconds": 17.03,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, my working impression is allergic rhinitis. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had sneezing fits for about three months, and no facial pain or shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.19,
      "end_seconds": 227.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.88,
      "end_seconds": 231.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just typing this up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.91,
      "end_seconds": 259.57,
      "duration_seconds": 15.66,
      "text": "Right, carry on. I'm going to order an allergy test, for allergic rhinitis. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'd like you to take levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, at night, for two weeks. It's for allergy symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.92,
      "end_seconds": 262.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.97,
      "end_seconds": 283.78,
      "duration_seconds": 19.81,
      "text": "Keep the windows closed in the early morning and wash the bedsheets weekly in hot water. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.88,
      "end_seconds": 286.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.55,
      "end_seconds": 289.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Come back in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.92,
      "end_seconds": 290.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.81,
      "end_seconds": 296.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.2,
      "end_seconds": 305.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "So, um, I take the levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, at night and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.87,
      "end_seconds": 310.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.0,
      "end_seconds": 314.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.24,
      "end_seconds": 315.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}